1
00:00:00,078 --> 00:00:03,360
计算机使用代理接收到一个任务和一个屏幕截图。
A computer use agent gets a task and a screenshot.

2
00:00:03,662 --> 00:00:05,120
它给出一个操作指令。
It answers with an action.

3
00:00:05,358 --> 00:00:07,364
比如点击这里、输入这个、按回车。
Click here, type this, press enter.

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,348
然后它会收到下一个屏幕截图。
Then it gets the next screenshot.

5
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:10,884
这个循环很简单。
The loop is simple.

6
00:00:11,246 --> 00:00:13,284
难点在于训练数据。
The hard part is the training data.

7
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:19,040
一篇名为 CUA-Master 的新论文，通过嵌套的两个循环来构建这些数据。
A new paper, see you a Master, builds that data with two loops, one inside the other.

8
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:29,924
在论文中，一个任务包含三个部分：指令、环境（这里是虚拟机）以及验证器，
即判断任务是否完成的检查机制。
In the paper, a task has three parts: an instruction, an environment here a
virtual machine, and a verifier, a check that decides if the task got done.

9
00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:33,412
屏幕和操作的记录被称为轨迹。
The record of screens and actions is a trajectory.

10
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:37,732
在这里，训练数据是指通过验证器的轨迹。
Here, training data means trajectories that pass their verifier.

11
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:42,884
人工可以记录轨迹，但这成本很高，而且覆盖的应用很少。
People can record trajectories, but that is expensive and covers few apps.

12
00:00:43,342 --> 00:00:49,668
生成的任务往往看起来很相似，难以控制，而且随着难度增加，失败率更高。
Generated tasks tend to look alike, are hard to steer, and fail more often as they get harder.

13
00:00:50,190 --> 00:00:55,200
而且如果模型只在自己的尝试上进行训练，它就只能停留在已知的范围内。
And a model that trains only on its own attempts stays inside what it already knows.

14
00:00:55,470 --> 00:00:56,080
第一部分。
Part 1.

15
00:00:56,334 --> 00:00:59,440
在内层循环中，这是第一个任务的来源。
Inside the inner loop, where the first tasks come from.

16
00:00:59,680 --> 00:01:01,680
它从教程视频开始。
It starts with tutorial videos.

17
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:07,908
作者在 YouTube、TikTok 和 Billy Billy 上搜索超过 600 个应用。
The authors search YouTube, TikTok, and Billy Billy app by app across more than 600 apps.

18
00:01:08,238 --> 00:01:13,668
一个独立的、通常更强大的模型作为标注者，给每个视频打分，范围是 0 到 5 分。
A separate, usually stronger model, the annotator, rates each video from 0 to 5.

19
00:01:14,158 --> 00:01:16,996
它是否展示了真实的计算机操作步骤？
Does it show real computer use step by step?

20
00:01:17,422 --> 00:01:19,812
优质的视频会被切分成独立的任务。
Good videos are cut into separate tasks.

21
00:01:20,110 --> 00:01:21,284
这些就是种子任务。
These are the seeds.

22
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:24,452
为了还原操作，必须有两个信号达成一致。
To recover the actions, two signals must agree.

23
00:01:25,038 --> 00:01:28,484
一个是旁白，比如「然后点击保存」这样的短语。
One is the narration, a phrase like then click save.

24
00:01:29,040 --> 00:01:32,560
另一个是画面，即屏幕发生变化的瞬间。
The other is the picture, a moment when the screen changes.

25
00:01:32,910 --> 00:01:36,164
如果两者都在一个时间窗口内，那它就是一个候选点。
If both land within a time window, that is a candidate.

26
00:01:36,654 --> 00:01:41,828
标注者会重新检查每个候选点，并记录点击位置或输入的文本。
The annotator rechecks each candidate and writes down the click position or the type text.

27
00:01:42,080 --> 00:01:42,756
第二部分。
Part 2.

28
00:01:43,310 --> 00:01:49,508
种子任务只覆盖了可能操作的一小部分，而且它们来自视频，而不是真实的运行过程。
Seeds cover only a small part of what is possible and they come from videos, not from real runs.

29
00:01:49,742 --> 00:01:50,884
所以它们需要被扩充。
So they multiply.

30
00:01:51,214 --> 00:01:58,084
每个种子任务都被分解成基础步骤，即在某个应用中可重复
使用的步骤，包含它的前提条件、设置以及自身的检查机制。
Each seed is broken into primitives, one reusable step in one app with its preconditions, its setup, and its own check.

31
00:01:58,606 --> 00:02:06,276
比如，把表格导出为文件，用脚本计算一列的总和，然
后把结果发邮件，这就是三个基础步骤，涉及三个应用。
Say, export a sheet as a file, total a column with a script, email the result, three primitives, three apps.

32
00:02:06,574 --> 00:02:10,948
标注人员编写一个任务，验证程序则负责合并这三个检查点。
The annotator writes one task and its verifier combines the three checks.

33
00:02:11,246 --> 00:02:15,428
两个调节旋钮来设定难度：基础步骤的数量和应用的数量。
Two dials set the difficulty, how many primitives and how many apps.

34
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:18,404
长任务往往会在某一个错误的步骤上失败。
Long tasks often fail at one wrong step.

35
00:02:18,830 --> 00:02:24,516
从头开始重试会浪费已经完成的部分，所以机器会在过程中保存快照。
Restarting from scratch wastes the good part, so the machine saves snapshots along the way.

36
00:02:25,038 --> 00:02:30,084
失败后，标注人员会找出最早出现的错误步骤，比如是第七步。
After a failure, the annotator finds the earliest bad step, say step seven.

37
00:02:30,638 --> 00:02:33,120
机器会回退到第六个快照。
The machine goes back to snapshot six.

38
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:39,268
智能体保留第一到第六步并重试，同时提供关于失败原因的提示，而不是直接给答案。
The agent keeps steps one to six and retries, with a hint about what failed, not the answer.

39
00:02:39,822 --> 00:02:48,580
对于跨越三个应用、包含40个基础步骤的任务，通过回退机制，
通过率从重试时的约15%提升到了约50%。
For tasks of 40 primitives across three apps, runs that passed went from about 15% with restarts to about 50 with rollback.

40
00:02:48,880 --> 00:02:49,572
第三部分。
Part 3.

41
00:02:49,966 --> 00:02:53,700
外层循环：训练、找出薄弱环节，然后针对下一轮进行优化。
The outer loop, train, find the weak spots, aim the next round.

42
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:58,720
模型从拥有270亿参数的 QN 3.5 开始。
The model starts from QN 3.5 with 27 billion parameters.

43
00:02:58,926 --> 00:03:02,756
它经过了微调，也就是在这些轨迹数据上进行了进一步训练。
It is fine-tuned, that is, trained further on the trajectories.

44
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:07,044
每一轮之后，作者都会按领域和应用来检查模型失败的地方。
After each round, the authors check where it fails by domain and by app.

45
00:03:07,534 --> 00:03:09,316
下一批数据就针对这些薄弱环节进行构建。
The next batch of data aims there.

46
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:15,012
一共三轮，任务数量分别为63,000个、38,000个，最后是14,000个。
Three rounds, 63,000 tasks, then 38,000, then 14,000.

47
00:03:15,662 --> 00:03:17,892
最后再进行一轮强化学习。
Then a last round of reinforcement learning.

48
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:23,492
模型在虚拟机中尝试任务，验证程序的结果即作为奖励。
The model tries tasks in virtual machines, and the verifier's result is the reward.

49
00:03:23,822 --> 00:03:28,004
智能体还可以向 shell 输入命令，也就是用于输入命令的文本窗口。
The agent can also type commands into a shell, the text window for commands.

50
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:31,040
shell 处理文件和批处理工作。
The shell handles files and batchwork.

51
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:33,828
屏幕处理需要查看和点击的操作。
The screen handles what has to be seen and clicked.

52
00:03:34,350 --> 00:03:40,260
在同时需要这两种能力的 Weave Bench 基准测试中，仅靠屏幕操作时，该模型的得分低于7分。
On Weave Bench, a benchmark that needs both, the same model scored under 7 with the screen alone.

53
00:03:40,814 --> 00:03:42,884
加入 shell 后，得分接近44分。
With the shell, almost 44.

54
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:47,760
在两个桌面基准测试中，得分略有下降，步骤也变少了。
On the two desktop benchmarks, the score dipped slightly, with fewer steps.

55
00:03:48,014 --> 00:03:50,116
第四部分，作者报告的内容。
Part 4 What the authors report.

56
00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:54,468
所有数据均为作者自己的运行结果，包括了对比模型。
All numbers are the author's own runs, comparison models included.

57
00:03:54,832 --> 00:04:01,552
在 OS World Verified 真实桌面任务中，基础模型的得分为54.6分。
On OS World Verified, real desktop tasks, the base model scored 54.6.

58
00:04:02,032 --> 00:04:04,836
CUA-Master 的得分为80.2分。
CU a Master scores 80.2.

59
00:04:05,422 --> 00:04:13,072
在 Agent's Last Exam 专家构建的工作任务基准测试中，
它解决了四分之一的任务，从之前的约1%大幅提升。
On Agent's Last Exam, a benchmark of expert-built work tasks, it fully solves a quarter, up from about 1%.

60
00:04:13,632 --> 00:04:23,140
两个闭源模型，Claude Opus 5 和 GPT 5.6 SAL，在论文提到的四个主要基准测试中得分均更高。
Two closed models, Claude Opus 5 and GPT 5.6 SAL, score higher on all four of the paper's main benchmarks.

61
00:04:23,472 --> 00:04:28,676
其他模型在其中一些指标上也领先，包括同等规模的更新版 Q-Win。
Other models lead on some of them too, including a newer Q-Win of the same size.

62
00:04:29,230 --> 00:04:30,052
有一些注意事项。
Some caveats.

63
00:04:30,606 --> 00:04:33,952
截至 11 月初，我们还没有发现任何独立的结果。
As of early November, we found no independent results.

64
00:04:34,286 --> 00:04:44,164
作者同时运行了 2000 多台虚拟机并在 128 个 GPU 上进行训练，
而且数据的质量取决于标注者的水平。
The authors ran over 2,000 virtual machines at once and trained on 128 GPUs, and the data is only as good as the annotator.

65
00:04:44,512 --> 00:04:48,228
当模型作为自己的标注者时，提升就没那么明显了。
With the model as its own annotator, the gains were smaller.

66
00:04:48,654 --> 00:04:50,372
权重和代码都是公开的。
The weights and the code are public.

67
00:04:50,832 --> 00:04:52,420
没有提供训练数据。
No training data is linked.

68
00:04:52,910 --> 00:04:58,884
所以任务来自真实的教程，通过基础步骤进行扩充，并记录了回滚过程。
So tasks come from real tutorials, multiply as primitives, and are recorded with rollback.

69
00:04:59,438 --> 00:05:01,924
模型的弱点决定了下一轮的任务。
The model's weak spots choose the next round.

70
00:05:02,432 --> 00:05:11,876
在我们这边，app WebentViklung.de 为没有界面或 API 的业务流程构建计算机使用代理。
On our side, app WebentViklung.de builds computer use agents for business processes that have no interface or API.

71
00:05:12,334 --> 00:05:13,956
链接就在描述栏里。
The link is in the description.

72
00:05:14,286 --> 00:05:17,252
论文、代码和模型链接都在下方。
The paper, the code, and the model are linked below.

